{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-8847e911cd251d5a4ad0d4b0734f86d9492cfc2af4a883c5","family_id":"KR:012159","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society","title_original":"4ㆍ16세월호참사 진상규명 및 안전사회 건설 등을 위한 특별법","kind":"법률","source_version":"284117","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=284117","source_sha256":"c141291f23520264444e31f7c7002ae169ff7b5f49b50f81aade863d8c364da6","body_sha256":"9fd4f05997b06081f8a314826ee9bb3ecb53c408c16b1cb22ceb299c296a970b","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 28 (Accusation and Request for Investigation) (1) If as a result of an investigation, the investigated matters are confirmed to be true and a criminal case is suspected, the Inquest shall file an accusation with the Prosecutor General: Provided, That where the accused is the military personnel or civilian personnel in the military service, the accusation shall be filed with the Chief of General Staff of the armed forces to which the said accused belongs or the Minister of National Defense. \n  (2) Where the Inquest deems that there is a high probability of a criminal act in the process of conducting investigations, the Inquest may request an investigative agency to perform investigations. \n  (3) The Prosecutor General shall designate a prosecutor to be in charge of the investigation of a case filed by the Inquest, the prosecution thereof, and maintenance of the prosecution, and take measures necessary for the prosecutor to be able to conduct investigations fairly and impartially. \n  (4) The Inquest may request the Minister of Justice to prohibit or suspend the departure of a person against whom the Inquest has filed an accusation or requested an investigation from the Republic of Korea.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.title.json","sha256":"4c74ab84248a6134281cf6996ae8261b572ae5b9e5754e6ad1e8c39880d0d84f"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-28.json","sha256":"fc6afa20df1de9350b4fca596200b649a57025d79ad6d1cd2381631981abc20c"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-28.selfcheck.json","sha256":"b094b64b5531f08984b07ea3b69a708e7d2c3c114e41501694c7b6a31473442a"},"text":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-28.txt","sha256":"6e56cdda60b37488ba1bb092dcdb5c36b40b4cb5ae3aa33b5e2b034e629cb21c"},"unit_key":"article-28"}],"body_and_addenda_complete":false,"component_id":"PARENT:kr-012159-284117-ko","component_ids":["PARENT:kr-012159-284117-ko:article-28"],"component_kind":"PARENT","edition_id":"edition-aaac9e18dc1283df53dd49fe3d7839553ade3b573357548d","frozen_scope_plan_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\direct_ingest_v1\\scope_plans\\initial_scope_plan_v1.json","sha256":"c0334ca2edfd0806c86cd904740b2afeaa6eae544bb2b58c126aef05d273eae4"},"human_or_official_review_claimed":false,"matrix_component_ids":["PARENT:kr-012159-284117-ko:article-28"],"matrix_unit_count":1,"multilingu